+/* Recovery advances shared balances only to the earliest verified cleanup
+ * instant. Every unfinished ENDING must have proof before any advance: a
+ * later-arriving older proof cannot be safely applied after other balances
+ * crossed tier or month boundaries. The WAL records each advance/release
+ * independently, so a crash between them replays at the same anchor. */
